{
    "title": "Perpay - Shop and Build Credit",
    "description": "Get up to $1,000 to spend now. Build credit by paying it back automatically each time you get paid. No crazy fees or predatory interest.\r\n\r\nSHOP THE PERPAY MARKETPLACE\r\n\r\nUnlock $1,000 to shop top brands in electronics, home goods, apparel and more on the Perpay Marketplace. Pay over time with no interest or fees.\r\n\r\nBUILD CREDIT WITH PERPAY+\r\n\r\nChoose to have your Perpay Marketplace payment history reported to all 3 credit bureaus to build credit while you shop.\r\n\r\nAPPLY FOR THE PERPAY CREDIT CARD\r\n\r\nAccess up to a $1,000 credit line and 2% rewards\u00b2 with no hard credit check, no security deposit and no annual fee\u00b9.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Perpay Credit Card is issued by Celtic Bank.\r\n\r\n\u00b9Annual fee: None. Monthly card servicing fee of $9. APR: the APR for the Perpay Credit Card can be found in the Cardholder Agreement: https://perpay.com/legal/credit-card-agreement\r\n\r\n\u00b2See our Rewards Agreement for more details on the Perpay Credit Card rewards program: https://perpay.com/legal/credit-card-rewards-program\r\n\r\nPerpay, Inc. 2400 Market Street Suite 300, Philadelphia, PA 19103",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get up to $1,000 to spend now. Build credit by paying it back automatically each time you get paid. No crazy fees or predatory interest.<br><br>SHOP THE PERPAY MARKETPLACE<br><br>Unlock $1,000 to shop top brands in electronics, home goods, apparel and more on the Perpay Marketplace. Pay over time with no interest or fees.<br><br>BUILD CREDIT WITH PERPAY+<br><br>Choose to have your Perpay Marketplace payment history reported to all 3 credit bureaus to build credit while you shop.<br><br>APPLY FOR THE PERPAY CREDIT CARD<br><br>Access up to a $1,000 credit line and 2% rewards\u00b2 with no hard credit check, no security deposit and no annual fee\u00b9.<br><br><br>The Perpay Credit Card is issued by Celtic Bank.<br><br>\u00b9Annual fee: None. Monthly card servicing fee of $9. APR: the APR for the Perpay Credit Card can be found in the Cardholder Agreement: https://perpay.com/legal/credit-card-agreement<br><br>\u00b2See our Rewards Agreement for more details on the Perpay Credit Card rewards program: https://perpay.com/legal/credit-card-rewards-program<br><br>Perpay, Inc. 2400 Market Street Suite 300, Philadelphia, PA 19103",
